@host = http://localhost:5044

### Suppliers
GET {{host}}/api/suppliers

### Create supplier
POST {{host}}/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Globex Parts", "email": "info@globex.test", "phone": "+45 12 34 56 78" }

### Duplicate supplier, expect 409
POST {{host}}/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Globex Parts" }

### Customers
GET {{host}}/api/customers

### Create customer
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Maria Nielsen", "email": "maria@example.test" }

### Duplicate email, expect 409
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Maria Again", "email": "maria@example.test" }

### Bad email, expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "No Good", "email": "not-an-email" }

### Update (use the real id)
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Maria Nielsen", "email": "maria@example.test", "phone": "+45 99 99 99 99", "isActive": true }